# 统一换行：shell 脚本与 Dockerfile 必须是 LF，
# 否则 Linux 上会报 "bad interpreter" 或 "syntax error near unexpected token"
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
# Windows 批处理保留 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
# 二进制文件不做转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.gz binary
*.whl binary
